Z||000014||phillip||03-22-2000||09:21 AM||||add this to your argument. every little bit helps. i remember an article in one of the major car mags where the writer was defending getting a small britsh sports car for his child.he said the low power out put(especially if your looking at a 4 cyl. and even v-6's don't have the power ratings of other popular and/or newer cars[ some of you v-6 guys may argue this point but hey, lets get him in  the car for now]) would help keep them out of trouble or give them more than they can handle. he also felt that with just two seats he couldn't fill it up with people and be distracted as easily from driving. toss those points in if you think they'll help.<BR>||||reg||1
